top_devices: description  -Ranking is over each device's own lifetime aggregate. -e.g. +To compare phones the user names, call `model_summary` for each of them instead. Ranking is over each device's own lifetime aggregate.
top_models: description  +Pair the metric with the right `order`: hottest = temperature_c + desc, fastest AC charging = ac_charge_hours + asc, best battery life = discharge_hours + desc. To compare phones the user names, call `model_summary` for each of them instead.
